{
  "meta": {
    "version": 1,
    "module": "sanitize",
    "source": "packages/core/src/sanitize/{index,htmlToText,css}.ts",
    "placeholderGif": "data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7",
    "inert": [
      {
        "name": "no dangerous tags",
        "regex": "<\\s*(script|iframe|frame|frameset|object|embed|applet|form|input|button|textarea|select|base|meta|link|svg|math|audio|video|source|template|noscript)\\b",
        "flags": "",
        "applyTo": "lower"
      },
      {
        "name": "no event handler attributes",
        "regex": "\\son[a-z]+\\s*=",
        "flags": "",
        "applyTo": "lowerValuesBlanked"
      },
      {
        "name": "no script URL schemes",
        "regex": "javascript\\s*:|vbscript\\s*:|livescript\\s*:",
        "flags": "",
        "applyTo": "lower"
      },
      {
        "name": "no css script hooks",
        "regex": "expression\\s*\\(|-moz-binding|behavior\\s*:",
        "flags": "",
        "applyTo": "lower"
      },
      {
        "name": "no fixed or sticky position",
        "regex": "position\\s*:\\s*(fixed|sticky)",
        "flags": "",
        "applyTo": "lower"
      },
      {
        "name": "no @import",
        "regex": "@import",
        "flags": "",
        "applyTo": "lower"
      },
      {
        "name": "no srcdoc",
        "regex": "\\ssrcdoc\\s*=",
        "flags": "",
        "applyTo": "lower"
      }
    ],
    "note": "sanitize expectations are properties, not exact output. Strings may contain {{PLACEHOLDER_GIF}}. runs overrides options once per entry. htmlRepeat builds html as before + unit*count + after. inert checks apply to the lowercased output; lowerValuesBlanked first replaces quoted attribute values with empty ones."
  },
  "cases": [
